  "rationale": "This suite targets previously untested contract clauses and partition boundaries: (1) Idempotent reserve replay after a release, confirming that the original response is returned and no stock is consumed; (2) Verification that a failed reservation due to insufficient stock does not occupy the key, allowing a subsequent retry to succeed once inventory is freed; (3) Cross-tenant release ensuring other tenants' reservations return not_found and do not alter stock; (4) Payload binding conflict specifically on sku changes (previously only qty variations were tested); (5) Exact case sensitivity ensuring no case folding occurs across tenants or keys; (6) Validation coverage for booleans, zero, out-of-bounds quantities (>10), empty tenant/key strings, and unsupported SKU identifiers; (7) Verification that input validation takes precedence over idempotency (string quantity on an existing key returns invalid instead of the cached response) and that extra fields are ignored.",
